/** \page epmRoadmap Roadmap
 *
 * ***IMPORTANT***
 * The energy computations are not scaled correctly (magnetic energy misses the 1/Ro factor)
 *
 * CSCS output misses possibilty to add other type of fields to output. For example, vorticity, helicity, toroidal, poloidal components etc
 *
 * This is an approximative roadmap for the next version(s).
 *
 * \section epmRoadV1 Version 1.y.z
 *    - A useful set of precision tests for the most important computations. These will also be very useful as regression tests for further
 *    changes to the code.
 *
 *    - Implement a reader class for NG_AshCode's HDF5 inner core data
 *
 *    - Add documentation until it is more or less usable by someone else than me ;)
 *
 *
 * \section epmRoadV2 Version 2.y.z
 *    - Do compiler tests to see which what is working and what not.
 *    
 *    - Finish implementation of ETD scheme. 
 *
 *    - Provide a simple implementation of an RK scheme.
 *
 *    - Implement new PolynomialOperators.
 *
 *    - Implement a more flexible and efficient PolynomialBasis/RadialBasis.
 *
 *    - Implement an approximative (continuous second derivative) radial basis. This will most likely required the two points above.
 *
 *    - Improve the MPI part of the code. There are a few Allgather/gather calls that should be modified. And general improvement is
 *    certainly also possible.
 *
 *    - Implement the pure SH splitting for completeness and testing purpose. It puts quite hard contrains on the whole code.
 *
 *    - Finish and cleanup the implementation of the different radial grids. The Chebyshev is currently used but a Legendre grid version is
 *    possible. A preliminary version is provided but not working yet.dd
 */
